        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Said to be part of an Arab battle flag.  Three pieces sewed together. Wide blue satin stripes divided by narrower red and green stripes. Design: Arabic letters, woven with white silk, on blue stripes, with Arabesques and floral ornament woven with yellow, red, blue, and cream colored silk on red and green stripes.  Very much worn."@en ;
